		{
			dependencies: ["0D75A0087DFCFCA4"]
			description: [
				"The &6Build Tool&f is how you place every colony building. Right-click a block with it to open the blueprint browser, pick a &estyle pack&f and a building, line up the preview, then confirm."
				""
				"This pack ships the default styles plus &dByzantine&f, &dAzurecrest&f (Lunara Colonies) and the &dStylecolonies&f packs (Antique, High Magic, Steampunk, FairyTale and more). A colony can mix styles freely."
				""
				"Use it now to place your &6Supply Camp&f (right-click with the Supply Camp item)."
			]
			id: "60F7E6EDEF3EED82"
			rewards: [
